---
// Dark Network Observatory Dashboard conforming to 机场品牌图表样式.txt
---
<section id="observatory" class="obs-section container">
  <div class="obs-header">
    <div class="obs-tag-row">
      <span class="obs-tag"><span class="status-dot"></span> LIVE NETWORK OBSERVATORY</span>
      <span class="obs-tag-sub">2026 全球跨境基础设施监测台</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="h2 obs-title">专线测速实验室 · 晚高峰流媒体与 AI 解锁拓扑</h2>
    <p class="body muted balance">
      参考 Cloudflare Dashboard 与 Grafana 网络可观测性监控标准设计。拒绝虚假宣传跑分，真实呈现主流 IEPL / IPLC 专线晚高峰实测延迟、丢包率及原生 IP 解锁矩阵。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="obs-grid">
    <!-- Panel 1: Performance Monitoring Report (测速报告面板) -->
    <div class="obs-card">
      <div class="card-bar">
        <div class="card-title-group">
          <span class="card-icon">⚡</span>
          <h3 class="body-sb" style="color: var(--white);">专线实测报告 (晚高峰 20:30 压测)</h3>
        </div>
        <span class="sys-badge operational">Operational</span>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card-env caption muted">
        软件环境: Clash Verge Rev / Speedtest · 测试入口: 上海/广州 BGP
      </div>

      <div class="speed-rows">
        <div class="speed-item">
          <div class="speed-head">
            <span class="node-name">🟢 香港 IEPL 01 (旗舰)</span>
            <span class="node-metrics">延迟: <strong style="color: #00e676;">22ms</strong> · 下载: <strong>529 Mbps</strong></span>
          </div>
          <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" style="width: 95%;"></div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="speed-item">
          <div class="speed-head">
            <span class="node-name">🟢 新加坡 IPLC 01</span>
            <span class="node-metrics">延迟: <strong style="color: #00e676;">42ms</strong> · 下载: <strong>445 Mbps</strong></span>
          </div>
          <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" style="width: 82%;"></div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="speed-item">
          <div class="speed-head">
            <span class="node-name">🟢 日本 东京 专线 01</span>
            <span class="node-metrics">延迟: <strong style="color: #00e676;">53ms</strong> · 下载: <strong>150 Mbps</strong></span>
          </div>
          <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" style="width: 65%;"></div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="speed-item">
          <div class="speed-head">
            <span class="node-name">🟡 台湾 BGP 直连</span>
            <span class="node-metrics">延迟: <strong>40ms</strong> · 下载: <strong>115 Mbps</strong></span>
          </div>
          <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" style="width: 55%; background: #ffb300;"></div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="speed-item">
          <div class="speed-head">
            <span class="node-name">🟡 美国 洛杉矶 优化</span>
            <span class="node-metrics">延迟: <strong>134ms</strong> · 下载: <strong>30 Mbps</strong></span>
          </div>
          <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" style="width: 38%; background: #ffb300;"></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card-summary">
        <span class="caption">汇总: 亚洲近端平均延迟 34ms | 峰值下载 547 Mbps | 0% 丢包率</span>
        <span class="watermark">[githubjichang.my]</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Panel 2: Service Availability Matrix (流媒体与 AI 解锁矩阵) -->
    <div class="obs-card">
      <div class="card-bar">
        <div class="card-title-group">
          <span class="card-icon">🎯</span>
          <h3 class="body-sb" style="color: var(--white);">服务可用性矩阵 (AI & Streaming)</h3>
        </div>
        <span class="sys-badge stable">Matrix v2.6</span>
      </div>

      <div class="card-env caption muted">
        自动化探针检测 · 判定标准: 原生住宅/机房 IP 解锁无阻断
      </div>

      <div class="matrix-grid">
        <div class="matrix-item is-pass">
          <div class="matrix-head"><span class="m-status">PASS</span> <strong>ChatGPT</strong></div>
          <p class="caption muted">OpenAI 官网/App 认证免手机验证</p>
        </div>

        <div class="matrix-item is-pass">
          <div class="matrix-head"><span class="m-status">PASS</span> <strong>Claude 3.5</strong></div>
          <p class="caption muted">Anthropic 原生支持无降级</p>
        </div>

        <div class="matrix-item is-warn">
          <div class="matrix-head"><span class="m-status warn">PARTIAL</span> <strong>Gemini</strong></div>
          <p class="caption muted">需指定美/日/新原生节点</p>
        </div>

        <div class="matrix-item is-pass">
          <div class="matrix-head"><span class="m-status">PASS</span> <strong>Netflix</strong></div>
          <p class="caption muted">非自制剧全区完整解锁</p>
        </div>

        <div class="matrix-item is-pass">
          <div class="matrix-head"><span class="m-status">PASS</span> <strong>Disney+</strong></div>
          <p class="caption muted">星空传媒全内容 4K HDR</p>
        </div>

        <div class="matrix-item is-pass">
          <div class="matrix-head"><span class="m-status">PASS</span> <strong>YouTube 4K</strong></div>
          <p class="caption muted">超高清视频缓冲 0 停顿</p>
        </div>

        <div class="matrix-item is-pass">
          <div class="matrix-head"><span class="m-status">PASS</span> <strong>TikTok 直播</strong></div>
          <p class="caption muted">跨区零黑屏直连带货</p>
        </div>

        <div class="matrix-item is-pass">
          <div class="matrix-head"><span class="m-status">PASS</span> <strong>Spotify</strong></div>
          <p class="caption muted">无区域限制高品质畅听</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card-summary">
        <span class="caption">测试工具: RegionRestrictionCheck & OpenAI API Probe</span>
        <span class="watermark">[githubjichang.my]</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Panel 3: Network Path Observatory (网络架构拓扑图) -->
  <div class="obs-topo-card">
    <div class="card-bar">
      <div class="card-title-group">
        <span class="card-icon">🗺️</span>
        <h3 class="body-sb" style="color: var(--white);">全链路专线传输拓扑架构 (Network Topology)</h3>
      </div>
      <span class="sys-badge verified">Verified Architecture</span>
    </div>

    <div class="topo-diagram">
      <div class="topo-node">
        <div class="topo-node-box">
          <span class="topo-role">CLIENT</span>
          <strong>用户本地设备</strong>
          <span class="caption muted">手机 / PC / 软路由</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="topo-arrow">
        <span class="topo-proto">VLESS / Trojan 加密</span>
        <div class="arrow-line"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="topo-node">
        <div class="topo-node-box bgp">
          <span class="topo-role">INGRESS</span>
          <strong>国内 BGP 智能中转</strong>
          <span class="caption muted">上海 / 广州 多线聚合</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="topo-arrow special">
        <span class="topo-proto iepl">⚡ IEPL 内网专线直连 (不经公网 GFW)</span>
        <div class="arrow-line thick"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="topo-node">
        <div class="topo-node-box egress">
          <span class="topo-role">EGRESS</span>
          <strong>海外原生出口落地</strong>
          <span class="caption muted">香港 / 东京 / 新加坡</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="topo-arrow">
        <span class="topo-proto">原生 IP 解锁</span>
        <div class="arrow-line"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="topo-node">
        <div class="topo-node-box dest">
          <span class="topo-role">TARGET</span>
          <strong>全球互联网与 AI</strong>
          <span class="caption muted">ChatGPT · Netflix · Google</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card-summary" style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <span class="caption">架构特征: 全程企业级内网专线光纤传输 · 防 QoS 阻断 · 避免 IP 污染 · 晚高峰超低抖动</span>
      <span class="watermark">[githubjichang.my]</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.obs-section {
  padding: 80px 20px;
}
.obs-header {
  text-align: center;
  max-width: 820px;
  margin: 0 auto 48px;
}
.obs-tag-row {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.obs-tag {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  font-family: monospace;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #00e676;
  background: rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.1);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.3);
  padding: 3px 10px;
  border-radius: 4px;
}
.status-dot {
  width: 7px;
  height: 7px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #00e676;
  box-shadow: 0 0 6px #00e676;
}
.obs-tag-sub {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--white-60);
}
.obs-title {
  color: var(--white);
  font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 38px);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

/* Grid */
.obs-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(360px, 1fr));
  gap: 24px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.obs-card {
  background: #0d121c;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 24px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
}
.card-bar {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.card-title-group {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
}
.card-icon {
  font-size: 18px;
}
.sys-badge {
  font-family: monospace;
  font-size: 11px;
  padding: 2px 8px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.sys-badge.operational {
  background: rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.15);
  color: #00e676;
  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.3);
}
.sys-badge.stable {
  background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
  color: #60a5fa;
  border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
}
.sys-badge.verified {
  background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15);
  color: #c084fc;
  border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3);
}
.card-env {
  font-family: monospace;
  font-size: 11px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  padding-bottom: 10px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
}

/* Speed Rows */
.speed-rows {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.speed-item {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 6px;
}
.speed-head {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  font-size: 13px;
}
.node-name {
  color: var(--white);
  font-family: monospace;
}
.node-metrics {
  color: var(--grey);
  font-family: monospace;
}
.progress-track {
  width: 100%;
  height: 6px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  border-radius: 3px;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.progress-fill {
  height: 100%;
  background: #00e676;
  border-radius: 3px;
}

/* Matrix */
.matrix-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.matrix-item {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 12px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4px;
}
.matrix-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--white);
}
.m-status {
  font-family: monospace;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  padding: 1px 4px;
  border-radius: 3px;
  background: rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.15);
  color: #00e676;
}
.m-status.warn {
  background: rgba(255, 179, 0, 0.15);
  color: #ffb300;
}

/* Card Summary & Watermark */
.card-summary {
  margin-top: auto;
  padding-top: 12px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  color: var(--white-60);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-family: monospace;
}
.watermark {
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}

/* Topo Card */
.obs-topo-card {
  background: #0a0e17;
  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.2);
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 28px;
  margin-top: 12px;
}
.topo-diagram {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 8px;
  margin: 32px 0 16px;
  overflow-x: auto;
  padding-bottom: 12px;
}
.topo-node {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}
.topo-node-box {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 16px;
  min-width: 150px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4px;
  text-align: center;
}
.topo-node-box.bgp {
  border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
  background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.05);
}
.topo-node-box.egress {
  border-color: rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.4);
  background: rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.05);
}
.topo-node-box.dest {
  border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);
  background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.05);
}
.topo-role {
  font-family: monospace;
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--white-40);
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}
.topo-arrow {
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  min-width: 80px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
}
.topo-proto {
  font-size: 10px;
  font-family: monospace;
  color: var(--white-60);
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.topo-proto.iepl {
  color: #00e676;
  font-weight: 700;
}
.arrow-line {
  width: 100%;
  height: 2px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  position: relative;
}
.arrow-line.thick {
  height: 4px;
  background: #00e676;
  box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.6);
}

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .matrix-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
